System Activity v1.01 by Qwert

Function:   Displays the Systemactivity

Features:   - online calculation
            - total-line
            - up to 9 nodes
            - checks number of lines of userterminal -> up to 14 days

Changes:    V1.01 Removed the bad Ansi 8) sorry !
            V1.0  First public release

