Installation:   Copy the whole directory to your "pfiles:"

                pfiles:Activity/Activity
                pfiles:Activity/Activity.ansi
                pfiles:Activity/Activity.dat

                You must start it as a CNet C program.

                Amiga Int'l is enough :)

Starting:       #2pfiles:Activity/Activity 3}
                                            ^-- number of ports(2-9) to display
